requirement {
  please help me generate a cli script named "ask_gemini.sh" to do the following:
  - accept a flag "-f", it will follow by a prompt file name, for example, we can do:
  sh ask_gemini.sh -f hello.prompt
  - it should automatically authenticate me using my gmail account and password
  - it should read the content of the hello.prompt, paste it automatically to https://gemini.google.com/app's text area and trigger the submit in chrome
  - let target_python_script = {replace ".prompt" to ".py" in {prompt file name}}
  - it will then capture the result, remove the "Python" word in the first line, save the result to {target_python_script}
}
